# Credential references for scripts/verify_v3.py. Values are resolved by
# `op run`, so no secret is ever written here or reaches the terminal.
#
# Replace <vault> and <item> with your own 1Password vault and item names, then
# save as env.op (gitignored).
GREENHOUSE_CLIENT_ID=op://<vault>/<item>/Client-key
GREENHOUSE_CLIENT_SECRET=op://<vault>/<item>/Client-secret
